 Corresponding Source on a durable physical medium with a reasonable
 opportunity for the recipient to obtain it.

 c) Convey individual copies of the object code with a copy of the
 Corresponding Source on a durable physical medium, accompanied by
 a written offer, valid for at least three years and valid for as
 long as you offer spare parts or the product, to give the
 Corresponding Source on a durable physical medium with a reasonable
 opportunity for the recipient to obtain it.

